Package: lab09-pkgtools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Package version comparison and installed-package audit
 vercmp compares Debian package versions using the dpkg algorithm,
 supporting epochs, tildes, and revisions.
 .
 pkgaudit inspects the local dpkg status database to report disk usage,
 dependency graphs, leaf packages, and system snapshots.
